Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.15,0:00:19.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:22.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Neste vídeo a gente atravessa o mapa de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ponta a ponta: a cidade, as praias, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:27.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ilhas, o pântano e até a tal montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.90,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E em cada parada eu te mostro o que a Rockstar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:32.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,copiou da vida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você vai jogar no lançamento, já se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,inscreve, porque essa semana o canal vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:37.61,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ferver.
