Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:40.20,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, um pouco de história.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:42.57,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City não é novidade na série.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.59,0:00:45.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ela apareceu em 2002, em GTA Vice City, presa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.81,0:00:48.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,nos anos oitenta, com terno pastel, neon e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:50.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trilha de sintetizador.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Era a Miami dos filmes de crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais de vinte anos depois, a cidade volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:59.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que agora nos dias de hoje, com celular na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:02.20,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mão, rede social e todo mundo filmando tudo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.13,0:00:40.12,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.37,0:00:42.49,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
