Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até agora, a Rockstar mostrou seis regiões.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:34.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City, a capital do neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:37.91,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida Keys, o colar de ilhas no sul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:40.12,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Port Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:44.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia, no interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:47.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o Mount Kalaga, um parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:49.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vamos uma por uma.
