Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.38,0:02:02.78,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}art déco em Miami Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:17.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:20.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami é conhecida como a capital mundial dos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:24.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cruzeiros, e Vice City tem porto, iate, lancha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:26.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e jet ski para todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os prédios espelhados do centro, as pontes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:31.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ligando a cidade à praia, as festas na beira
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:32.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:35.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem já viu Miami de perto vai reconhecer a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:36.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade em segundos.
