Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:40.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Descendo para o sul, chegamos em Leonida Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:43.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, as Florida Keys são uma corrente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:46.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ilhas ligadas por uma única estrada sobre o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.87,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mar, a Overseas Highway, com quarenta e duas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:49.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pontes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:52.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Uma delas tem quase onze quilômetros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:55.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É água azul-turquesa dos dois lados, barco de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:58.43,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pesca, bar de praia e muita gente fugindo da
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:02:59.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers, essa vibe aparece em festa em
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:04.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,barco, passeio de lancha e areia branca.
