Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:35.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Do outro lado do estado, na costa do Golfo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:37.05,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fica Port Gellhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:40.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se Vice City é o cartão-postal, Port Gellhorn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:42.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,é a praia que ficou para trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:44.99,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Cidade portuária, motel de beira de estrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:48.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,casa noturna com letreiro piscando e bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:48.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,glamour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:51.32,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a inspiração vem do norte da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:53.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,costa do Golfo da Flórida, a região que os
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.61,Legenda,,0,0,0,,americanos chamam de Panhandle.
